---
source: worktree/cli/tests/list_flags.rs
expression: "offered.join(\"\\n\")"
---
--fast-forward	Fast-forward the local default branch to origin/<default> (listing only)
--help	Print help
--ignore-api	Check origin with Git only, never the provider API, for this repository from now on (listing only; recorded in ~/.wt.json)
--perf	Emit a performance report to stderr after command completion
--refresh	Wait for a full update from origin, up to 75 s instead of 3 s (listing only)
--verbose	Show detailed commit history for the current worktree
--version	Print version
--width	Override the git graph width (e.g. "70", "70ch", "50%")
